alse,"text":["如果每个人都依照自己的判断，肆意对自己所认为的“恶”动用私刑，我们的社会秩序将不复存在。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"16":{"step":[[16,17,""]],"type":1,"name":["埃尔登警长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500823","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我保证，我们会始终竭尽全力，致力于让一切变得更好。<br>这正是我们的职责所在。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["埃尔登警长","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500824","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但市民朋友们，如果你们也心怀正义与热情，和我们一样希望这个世界变得更好——我代表神秘学犯罪科，期待着来自你们的意见与帮助。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["记者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632501.png","audio":"612500268","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["洛杉矶警署发布公告，将于明年增加大量神秘学警察岗位，缓解神秘学犯罪科人手不足的问题。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,152,""]],"type":1,"name":["记者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"632501.png","audio":"612500269","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["新一代的神秘学警察招募计划已经启动，圣洛夫基金会夜巡特遣管理局也将参与到培训计划当中，有兴趣的市民朋友可以致电咨询——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["听到电视中的消息，女子欣喜地看向靠坐在床上的男子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["女子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"631601.png","audio":"612500601","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["哎呀，要招神秘学警察？这下可好了！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["女子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"631601.png","audio":"612500602","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你年轻的时候，不是就想要当警察吗？<br>刚好你还没有超过上面的限制年龄，等出了院，要不要去问问？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["男子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"630501.png","audio":"612500666","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["乱讲什么呢！<br>我已经卖了二十年蔬菜水果了，事到如今，怎么可能做得了警察？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["病床上的男子连连摆手，一边朝妻子挤眉弄眼，一边不安地望向床侧的另一名男子，料想他必然会破口大骂。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但对方的反应却出乎他的意料。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["民间侦探","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500641","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……看我做什么？想做就试试呗。<br>有更多自己人穿上那身制服，街坊们遇到事情时，也会免去很多烦恼。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["民间侦探","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500642","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我看他们那个警署里也有不少一把年纪，胳膊上却一道杠都没有的家伙。<br>你这老好人除了有时候太好说话外，没什么缺点，不一定比他们差。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一旁的梁月见状笑了笑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501880","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是呀，黄叔叔。我看您的身体很好，在神秘术方面也很有天赋，通过培训对您来说应当并不是一件不可能的事。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501881","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["成为警察并不容易，但也并没有那样困难——我想最重要的，是一颗向往公平与正义的心，以及保护他人的勇气与爱。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501882","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["医生说您的身体已经恢复，不久后便可以出院。<br>如果您有兴趣，不妨来试一试。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["男子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"630501.png","audio":"612500667","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["这……既然小梁警官这样说，那我会考虑的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["女子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"631601.png","audio":"612500603","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["这次多亏了你了，姑娘！听说是你让大家伙都恢复了原样。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":1,"name":["女子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"631601.png","audio":"612500604","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你是我们的大恩人呀！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["女子抓起梁月的手，热切地握住。<br>这一次她的手不再颤抖，梁月回握时也不再犹豫。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_5/2_5_at_chengnuo2_zone.png","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311001.png","audio":"612501883","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["您过奖了，这是我应该做的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"39":{"step":[[39,40,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311001.png","audio":"612501884","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["而且这也不是我一个人的功劳——是大家的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_5/2_5_at_chengnuo2_zone.png","choice":[]},"40":{"step":[[40,42,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/kangfuzhongxin.jpg","choice":[]},"42":{"step":[[42,43,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501109","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这下放心了吧？我告诉过你了，那些因为被卷入《三燕归巢》制造的神秘学现象而精神失常的无辜受害者们，都恢复了原样。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/kangfuzhongxin.jpg","choice":[]},"43":{"step":[[43,44,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501110","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["症状轻些的已经活蹦乱跳了，像里面那个倒霉鬼那样严重些的，状况也大为好转，想来再过段时间，就能恢复如初了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"44":{"step":[[44,45,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501111","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["奇星持胶片袭击的那些人也一样，他们丢失的——呃，你那个说法叫什么来着？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"45":{"step":[[45,46,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一旁的泥鯭的士无奈地摊了摊手。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["泥鯭的士","","An-an Lee","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500315","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是“三魂七魄”啦，madam。<br>如果你实在记不住这个发音，就叫它“精神力量”或是“神智”就可以了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["泥鯭的士","","An-an Lee","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500316","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那些被奇星借胶片力量修理的坏家伙们也恢复了正常——不过，这里仅指他们的精神。那个靓女下手不轻，恐怕他们还要在医院躺一阵子呢。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501885","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但至少最终在这一连串事件中，并没有出现死者……我想这是不幸中的万幸。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501112","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那个偏执狂下手终究还是有分寸。<br>也许在心里，她其实从未真的傲慢地自诩为“正义的代言人”……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501113","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……算了，虽然我自己也是神秘学家，但做这行之后，你就会意识到那些血脉中的疯狂，往往会在神秘学家罪犯身上体现得淋漓尽致。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501114","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["试图理解他们从一开始就是无用功。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501886","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["也许吧，但……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501887","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我想人与人——或是个体与个体之间，只要愿意去尝试，我们仍然是可以无限趋近于相互理解的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她从口袋中掏出了那只从六岁起便随身携带、未曾离身的大哥大。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但此时它的屏幕暗了下去，无论梁月再如何呼唤寄宿在其中的兽魂，都得不到半点回应。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501888","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……只要愿意尝试。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["怀抱着几分微薄的希望，梁月按下大哥大上的按键摆弄了一番。<br>它的屏幕会正常亮起，但按下拨号键时，听筒中只有死寂。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501115","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……你的强梁，还是没有回应吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["梁月垂下眼眸，摇了摇头。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["泥鯭的士","","An-an Lee","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500317","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这也难怪，那天的那个大家伙可不好对付。<br>那盘胶片本身虽然并不是什么特别有来头的东西，但无奈特性非同寻常。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["泥鯭的士","","An-an Lee","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500318","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["什么孤魂野鬼、魑魅魍魉……各路妖魔鬼怪，只要是能钻进那张胶片的都来了，人头比大排档都多！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["泥鯭的士","","An-an Lee","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500319","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["偏偏它们又裹挟了那些受害者们丢失了的“三魂七魄”，若是能够不管不顾地将其消灭，恐怕以险道兽强梁之能，还不至于搭上自己，但……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["泥鯭的士没有将剩下的话说下去，那对于面前低落的见习执夜人来说，未免有些过于残忍了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501889","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这下我真的将强梁给弄丢了，我都不知道该如何向家里人交代。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612501890","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……但关于强梁最让我耿耿于怀的，是另外一件事。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_5/2_5_at_yanhua1.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311016.png","audio":"612501891","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那个时候，我还以为自己要死了。<br>但强梁它看了我一会儿，将我推开，独自去承担了一切。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311001.png","audio":"612501892","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["为什么它要帮我到这个地步？<br>仅仅因为我是它的侲子吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311001.png","audio":"612501893","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我不这么认为。<br>我总觉得那个时候，它有什么话想要对我说。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_5/2_5_at_yanhua2.jpg","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311013.png","audio":"612501894","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……但我却读不懂，它想要和我说些什么。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311001.png","audio":"612501895","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["从六岁起，它便理所当然般陪伴在我的左右，但我一直将它视作一种重负，一份责任，一件能够斩杀敌人、却也容易刺伤自己的利器……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311013.png","audio":"612501896","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["却从来没有想过，强梁也会有它的想法。<br>我从来没有尝试去了解它。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["梁月","","Liang","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311013.png","audio":"612501897","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["而现在也许一切都已经太迟了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["梁月叹出一口气，不再言语。<br>一旁的二人见状对视一眼，不约而同地分别拍上梁月一侧的肩头。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/kangfuzhongxin.jpg","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["泥鯭的士","","An-an Lee","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612500320","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["别哭丧着个脸嘛，靓女！事情也许还有转机，我也会帮助你的。<br>我可是专业人士，如果是你的话，可以打折哦！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["波蒂埃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6125011